gitrl-z (0.2.1-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Drop the libdazzle build dependency. It was used for a single helper, a
    Pango font description to CSS conversion, now reimplemented locally.
    libdazzle is no longer in the Ubuntu archive as of 26.04, so removing it
    lets the package build there.

 -- alexandros filotheou <alexandros.filotheou@gmail.com>  Sun, 26 Jul 2026 16:05:23 +0200

gitrl-z (0.2.0-2) noble; urgency=medium

  * Add git to Build-Depends. meson finds the program at configure time and
    the unit suite builds fixture repositories with it, so a clean buildd
    without git failed to configure.

 -- alexandros filotheou <alexandros.filotheou@gmail.com>  Sun, 26 Jul 2026 12:07:48 +0200

gitrl-z (0.2.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Preview and recover from a detached HEAD.
  * Show the git command that each reflog entry records.
  * Warn while a git operation is in progress and offer to abort it.
  * Mark the checked-out branch, and offer to bring back a deleted or
    recreated branch.
  * Steady the graph under the command banner, open the reflog panels at
    equal height, reword the captions and trim the preferences.

 -- alexandros filotheou <alexandros.filotheou@gmail.com>  Sun, 26 Jul 2026 10:42:06 +0200

